pytorchReplicaSpecs.description:
A map of PyTorchReplicaType (type) to ReplicaSpec (value). Specifies the PyTorch cluster configuration. For example,
  {
    "Master": PyTorchReplicaSpec,
    "Worker": PyTorchReplicaSpec,
  }

tfReplicaSpecs.description:
A map of TFReplicaType (type) to ReplicaSpec (value). Specifies the TF cluster configuration. For example,
  {
    "PS": ReplicaSpec,
    "Worker": ReplicaSpec,
  }
